<title>USA: Des Plaines, Ill., won by Piper Jaffray. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Des Plaines, Ill., won by Piper Jaffray. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc (corrects from Dain Bosworth) said it won $10 million Des Plaines, Ill., various general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.7904 (corrects from 4.772) percent.</p>
</text>
